---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Version } from "../lib/version";
---

<Layout title="About | AI Adventure">
  <main class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>

      <h1>About AI Adventure</h1>

      <p class="introduction">
        AI Adventure is an open framework for creating, sharing and playing
        AI-powered interactive adventures.
      </p>
    </header>

    <h2>What is AI Adventure?</h2>

    <p>
      Traditional interactive fiction follows a script. AI Adventure takes a
      different approach.
    </p>

    <p>
     Each adventure describes a world, its rules, important truths, 
     characters and goals, while the AI creates a unique playthrough based on the player's choices.
    </p>

    <p>
      The result is an adventure that remains recognisable between
      playthroughs, while allowing different conversations, discoveries,
      puzzles and solutions to emerge naturally.
    </p>

    <h2>Open Framework</h2>

    <p>
      AI Adventure is designed to work across many capable AI systems rather
      than being tied to a single AI provider or platform.
    </p>

    <p>
      The AI Adventure Guide, Adventure Format and example adventures are all released 
      under the Creative Commons CC0 licence, encouraging anyone to create, modify, 
      share and build upon compatible adventures.
    </p>

    <p>
      See the <a href="/documentation/">Documentation</a> section for the Guide,
      format specification and other project information.
    </p>

    <h2>Philosophy</h2>

    <p>
      AI Adventure separates the adventure from the AI that runs it.
    </p>

    <p>
      Rather than scripting every possible action, adventures describe worlds, rules,
       characters, discoveries and immutable truths. This allows different AI systems 
       to interpret the same adventure in their own way while remaining faithful to 
       the author's intent.
    </p>

    <h2>Current Version</h2>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Component</th>
          <th>Version</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Framework</td>
          <td><strong>v{Version.framework}</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>AI Adventure Guide</td>
          <td><strong>v{Version.guide}</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Adventure Format</td>
          <td><strong>v{Version.format}</strong></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Support the Project</h2>

    <p>
      AI Adventure will always remain free to use.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you've enjoyed playing or building adventures, you're welcome to
      <a
        href="https://ko-fi.com/ai_adventure"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      > shout AI Adventure a tea
      </a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Every contribution helps support the continued development of the framework, 
      documentation, website and adventures while keeping AI Adventure free and 
      open for everyone.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>